GY_PENGUINS_PENGU_PFP.png?1733809110"}},{"id":75,"code":"AR","title":"Arweave","slug":"arweave","description":"Arweave is a data storage protocol built on blockweave technology. Arweave is developing an underlying network where data can be stored forever and accessed on its permaweb, a secondary layer where data is accessible in a human-readable manner (e.g. via web browsers). ","image_url":"https://blockworks-assets.imgix.net/4343/large/oRt6SiEN_400x400.jpg?1696504946","price_usd":2.82,"sector":"File Storage","market_cap":{"rank":215,"usd":184974936,"dominance":0.000641589,"percent_change_btc_1h":1.8,"percent_change_btc_24h":-4.2583,"percent_change_usd_1h":1.8,"percent_change_usd_24h":-5.09131,"percent_change_usd_7d":25,"percent_change_usd_30d":56.4,"percent_change_usd_ytd":-25.255,"percent_change_eth_1h":1.8,"percent_change_eth_24h":-4.79468,"updated_at":1788900501},"project":{"id":1175,"title":"Arweave","slug":"arweave","image_url":"https://blockworks-assets.imgix.net/4343/large/oRt6SiEN_400x400.jpg?1696504946"}}],"total":155,"page":1},"podcasts":[{"id":"fe2cdbd0-5480-11ed-a0b3-fff47680c6ce","episodes":[{"id":"691a1c3e-a63d-11f1-a478-f7a6f4db9b91","href":"/podcast/0xresearch/691a1c3e-a63d-11f1-a478-f7a6f4db9b91","dateReleased":1788343200000,"timeDurationSeconds":3960.54,"title":"Is Robinhood Chain Reigniting Crypto’s Retail Economy?","description":"Crypto’s retail engine is turning back on, but can this new wave of onchain activity actually sustain itself?\n\nThis week, the crew breaks down why Robinhood Chain, the meme-tokenized equity meta, and social trading are emerging as major growth drivers for..","audioPlayerData":{"title":"Is Robinhood Chain Reigniting Crypto’s Retail Economy?","show":"0xResearch","audio":{"src":"https://traffic.megaphone.fm/BWG9921175876.mp3","type":"mp3"},"link":"/podcast/0xresearch/691a1c3e-a63d-11f1-a478-f7a6f4db9b91"},"episode":{"id":"691a1c3e-a63d-11f1-a478-f7a6f4db9b91","createdAt":"2026-09-01T19:43:31.208Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-02T10:00:01.679Z","title":"Is Robinhood Chain Reigniting Crypto’s Retail Economy?","pubdate":"2026-09-02T10:00:00.000Z","link":null,"author":"Blockworks","imageFile":"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/691a1c3e-a63d-11f1-a478-f7a6f4db9b91/image/6debdd84aea1461419e0925e534969a2.jpg?ixlib=rails-4.3.1","explicit":null,"episodeType":"full","seasonNumber":null,"episodeNumber":null,"subtitle":"","summary":"\u003cp\u003eCrypto’s retail engine is turning back on, but can this new wave of onchain activity actually sustain itself?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis week, the crew breaks down why Robinhood Chain, the meme-tokenized equity meta, and social trading are emerging as major growth drivers for crypto.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe also dig into Uniswap’s surge, FOMO’s breakout potential, Ethena’s token reset, and whether crypto DATs can make a comeback. Enjoy!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTIMESTAMPS:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e00:00 Sentiment Check\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e03:45 Why Robinhood Trenches Are Exploding\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10:10 Does The Meme-Equity Meta Have Legs?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e16:17 Do Tokenized Equities Really Matter?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e20:28 Is Robinhood Chain Priced In?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e24:30 Ads (Token2049)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e25:23 Can Base Catch Robinhood Chain?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e28:48 Uniswap’s Robinhood Breakout\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e35:09 Is FOMO Crypto’s Breakout App?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e49:02 Ethena Makes ENA Investable Again\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e56:25 Are Crypto DATs Back?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e01:00:27 What Matters Into Year-End?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFOLLOW THE SHOW\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› 0xResearch – https://x.com/0xResearch\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Luke – https:/