/ef38aea4-a708-11f1-aab6-ab8eb8d899c2","dateReleased":1788775200000,"timeDurationSeconds":4286.17,"title":"Cloudflare CEO: The Man Deciding The Internet’s Next Business Model","description":"What happens when AI agents become the internet’s dominant users?\n\nThis week, Jason sits down with Cloudflare CEO Matthew Prince to explore how AI agents could fundamentally reshape the internet’s business model.\n\nThey discuss 1,000x agent traffic, why everything wrong with the..","audioPlayerData":{"title":"Cloudflare CEO: The Man Deciding The Internet’s Next Business Model","show":"Empire","audio":{"src":"https://traffic.megaphone.fm/BWG2913922005.mp3","type":"mp3"},"link":"/podcast/empire/ef38aea4-a708-11f1-aab6-ab8eb8d899c2"},"episode":{"id":"ef38aea4-a708-11f1-aab6-ab8eb8d899c2","createdAt":"2026-09-02T20:00:24.032Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-02T20:21:19.270Z","title":"Cloudflare CEO: The Man Deciding The Internet’s Next Business Model","pubdate":"2026-09-07T10:00:00.000Z","link":null,"author":"Blockworks","imageFile":"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/ef38aea4-a708-11f1-aab6-ab8eb8d899c2/image/57f03a4257467c1e60d9eb316c81228f.png?ixlib=rails-4.3.1","explicit":null,"episodeType":"full","seasonNumber":null,"episodeNumber":null,"subtitle":"","summary":"\u003cp\u003eWhat happens when AI agents become the internet’s dominant users?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis week, Jason sits down with Cloudflare CEO Matthew Prince to explore how AI agents could fundamentally reshape the internet’s business model.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThey discuss 1,000x agent traffic, why everything wrong with the world is Google's fault, AI flattening organizations, micropayments at unprecedented scale, and whether AI becomes the new interface to the internet. Enjoy!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTIMESTAMPS:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e00:00 Intro\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\