BkF8Ro10Y6kEd1BlzXyvI1xoz%2FdR2yiSuyD6QQgsuJgS02wHRXIiz0AHzQGkIehspgOxxJppi5RWQU5lTRdQ9M%2FuRARha8xV5c957VWXagQlL8%2FjNgChH3KFVvqOohiJT9uEvhfgjfPZb4P7%2B2CeOznQLlbKb6jX4M35wFifJIAwSgO3X%2B3oKigmcKGc407v6N7XR4J2guHJM%2BIil0p1m%2BNLmqGFP7Y83EWyyvM32gpwUj9C4TE5CxToY6hZ0LrNjU2W6s4L%2FkBamn3VwwVL2rhL%2B3F9Q%3D%3D","advertisingTags":[],"mainFeed":true,"adFree":false,"audioFileStatus":"success","status":"published","rssStatus":"published","spotifyStatus":"live","cuepoints":[],"mediaFileUrl":null,"imageFileUrl":null}},{"id":"020f925c-7402-11f1-8dd2-2f1d9fd9b5ea","href":"/podcast/inflectionpoint/020f925c-7402-11f1-8dd2-2f1d9fd9b5ea","dateReleased":1782889200000,"timeDurationSeconds":3222.8,"title":"SEC Commissioner Hester Peirce On The Rulebook For Crypto \u0026 Tokenized Securities","description":"Markets are being rebuilt around blockchain, but the rules governing them are still being written.\n\nThis week, we sit down with SEC Commissioner Hester Peirce to discuss how tokenization is reshaping market structure and where regulation is headed next.\n\nWe cover tokenized..","audioPlayerData":{"title":"SEC Commissioner Hester Peirce On The Rulebook For Crypto \u0026 Tokenized Securities","show":"Inflection Point","audio":{"src":"https://traffic.megaphone.fm/BWG7081474387.mp3","type":"mp3"},"link":"/podcast/inflectionpoint/020f925c-7402-11f1-8dd2-2f1d9fd9b5ea"},"episode":{"id":"020f925c-7402-11f1-8dd2-2f1d9fd9b5ea","createdAt":"2026-06-29T21:32:19.875Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-01T00:45:01.778Z","title":"SEC Commissioner Hester Peirce On The Rulebook For Crypto \u0026 Tokenized Securities","pubdate":"2026-07-01T07:00:00.000Z","link":null,"author":"Blockworks","imageFile":"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/020f925c-7402-11f1-8dd2-2f1d9fd9b5ea/image/e962f90fe42381a818bfd304f68da892.jpg?ixlib=rails-4.3.1","explicit":null,"episodeType":"full","seasonNumber":null,"episodeNumber":null,"subtitle":"","summary":"\u003cp\u003eMarkets are being rebuilt around blockchain, but the rules governing them are still being written.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis week, we sit down with SEC Commissioner Hester Peirce to discuss how tokenization is reshaping market structure and where regulation is headed next.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe cover tokenized securities, the innovation exemption, Rule 611, DeFi market structure, and the future of public markets. Enjoy!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTIMESTAMPS:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e00:00 Intro\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e02:19 What People Misread About The SEC\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e05:07 Hester Peirce’s Regulatory Path\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e09:10 Tokenized Securities Framework\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e12:21 The Innovation Exemption Debate\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e16:11 Does Rule 611 Block DeFi?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e20:27 Where Registration Should Attach\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e25:16 Onchain Finance vs DeFi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e32:30 Crypto’s Remaining Gray Areas\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e40:12 Making Public Markets Work Again\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e46:13 Tokenized Securities Models\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFOLLOW COMMISSIONER PEIRCE\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› X/Twitter – https://x.com/HesterPeirce\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFOLLOW THE SHOW\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Inflection Point – https://x.com/BWInflection\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Marc – https://x.com/marcarjoon\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Matt – https://x.com/Matt_Hougan\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› David – https://x.com/dlawant\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Michael – https://x.com/marcryptonio\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Blockworks – https://x.com/Blockworks\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c