name":"06.29.26_IP_#18_Hester.mp4","spotifyIdentifier":"4CbNULF1JOTnYRRXu0z59R","expectedAdhash":"","audioFileUpdatedAt":null,"draft":false,"externalId":null,"cleanTitle":"","customFields":[],"contentRating":"unspecified","episodeConfigType":"podcast","promotionalContent":false,"podcastTitle":"Inflection Point","networkId":"104de192-0570-11e9-af98-f39c567501b8","podcastAuthor":"Blockworks","podcastItunesCategories":["Tech News","Business News","Investing"],"episodeVideoThumbnailUrl":"https://storage.googleapis.com/megaphone-prod/podcasts/701a8bb0-75e0-11eb-b1ed-cb043298ccf9/thumbnails/031dc128-7402-11f1-8dd2-ab0697af0397/7b42dc71991a91212b10e610f713c74b.jpeg?GoogleAccessId=megaphone-cms%40megaphone-prod.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u0026Expires=1789458785\u0026Signature=VuAxC3vpZ7bOStJV%2FSTWr%2BJqxfeLPq4q1s407YSMihZuf0%2B1Vr%2BrZDGbnS2H5uAPPw4rCSx7485Rh38cUmwgfeob%2BcktXqlkcWKmplEDvMgz%2Fn8i%2FZRJ81U2ot1MBIBCZGwuXUYZKDaLraqu2IVYNsThX0gJM4m7Wu3w8TUMDx1NucauQDes%2FJtkJfriw%2B%2Bg4ob64lir5J1wAehU9HpFFAOwDeT8SOASlSlC0r6NsJ%2F%2B76Da%2B9VzSHqElTIZZ0hkzIkR5gPCkUfcwkaYg1A%2F33dK3%2BcOHdGCHiJlzBoMmhxglc7YKVXaYq5cHg8iVUREKrwN9%2FJrD3pc0pX3N86mHg%3D%3D","advertisingTags":[],"mainFeed":true,"adFree":false,"audioFileStatus":"success","status":"published","rssStatus":"published","spotifyStatus":"live","cuepoints":[],"mediaFileUrl":null,"imageFileUrl":null}},{"id":"aa675600-6f49-11f1-af3d-1b109f6b8c95","href":"/podcast/inflectionpoint/aa675600-6f49-11f1-af3d-1b109f6b8c95","dateReleased":1782284400000,"timeDurationSeconds":3851.57,"title":"Is Strategy’s Credit Machine Starting To Crack?","description":"Strategy built a Bitcoin credit machine and now the market is testing whether it really works.\n\nThis week, we examine the growing pressure on Strategy as STRC trades below par, investors questioning the company’s evolving role, and how the market reassesses..","audioPlayerData":{"title":"Is Strategy’s Credit Machine Starting To Crack?","show":"Inflection Point","audio":{"src":"https://traffic.megaphone.fm/BWG9194503674.mp3","type":"mp3"},"link":"/podcast/inflectionpoint/aa675600-6f49-11f1-af3d-1b109f6b8c95"},"episode":{"id":"aa675600-6f49-11f1-af3d-1b109f6b8c95","createdAt":"2026-06-23T21:22:40.759Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-23T22:12:22.308Z","title":"Is Strategy’s Credit Machine Starting To Crack?","pubdate":"2026-06-24T07:00:00.000Z","link":null,"author":"Blockworks","imageFile":"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/aa675600-6f49-11f1-af3d-1b109f6b8c95/image/e962f90fe42381a818bfd304f68da892.jpg?ixlib=rails-4.3.1","explicit":null,"episodeType":"full","seasonNumber":null,"episodeNumber":null,"subtitle":"","summary":"\u003cp\u003eStrategy built a Bitcoin credit machine and now the market is testing whether it really works.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis week, we examine the growing pressure on Strategy as STRC trades below par, investors questioning the company’s evolving role, and how the market reassesses the assumptions behind its Bitcoin-backed capital structure.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe  also discuss what it would take for STRC to recover, Bitmine copying Strategy, how AI may be draining liquidity from crypto, and why a shift away from the AI trade could reshape Bitcoin’s next cycle. Enjoy!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTIMESTAMPS:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e00:00 Intro\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e01:32 FIFA World Cup\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e03:59 Sports Betting \u0026amp; Prediction Markets\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e11:29 South Korea Sparks AI Fears\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e15:25 Clarity Act Odds Dropping\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e20:16 AI Trade Nears A Turn\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e26:13 Strategy’s STRC Problem\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e37:58 Is Strategy's Model Changing?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e43:34 What Gets STRC To Par?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e51:08 Should Strategy Buy STRC?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e53:35 Bitmine Follows Saylor’s Playbook\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e59:43 Hester Pierce And World Cup\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFOLLOW THE SHOW\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Inflection Point – https://x.com/BWInflection\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Marc – https://x.com/marcarjoon\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Matt – https://x.com/Matt_Hougan\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› David – https://x.com/dlawant\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Michael – https://x.com/marcryptonio\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Blockworks – https://x.com/Blockworks\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEVENTS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e› Join us at Digital Asset Summit 2026 Asia October 7th \u0026amp; Digital Asset 2026 London November 10-11th\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ehttps://blockworks.com/events\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlockworks recently acquired Messari. For more information, please visit: https://blockworks.com/insights/blockworks-acquires-messari\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDISCLAIMER\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNothing said on Inflection Point is a recommendation to buy or sell securities or tokens. This podcast is for informational purposes only. Any views expressed are opinions, not financial advice. Hosts and guests may hold positions in the companies, funds, or projects discussed.\u003c/p\u003e","audioFile":"https://storage.googleapis.com/off-platform-audio-distribution/922bb44f76206a05551e4a468ccc6d25ae2b7fa4?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256\u0026X-Goog-Credential=creator-media-transcoder%40gke-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260908%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\u0026X-Goog-Date=20260908T075306Z\u0026X-Goog-Expires=172800\u0026X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host\u0026X-Goog-","downloadUrl":"https://traffic.megaphone.fm/BWG9194503674.mp3","size":2566134958,"duration":"3851.57","uid":"BWG9194503674","originalUrl":null,"bitrate":320,"samplerate":48000,"channelMode":"stereo","vbr":null,"audioFileProcessing":false,"podcastId":"701a8bb0-75e0-11eb-b1ed-cb043298ccf9","preCount":null,"postCount":null,"insertionPoints":[],"preOffset":null,"postOffset":null,"id3File":"https://static.megaphone.fm/podcasts/701a8bb0-75e0-11eb-b1ed-cb043298ccf9/episodes/aa675600-6f49-11f1-af3d-1b109f6b8c95/id3/9db7d872331edd4f7dedabbec10b9bc1.mp3","id3FileProcessing":false,"id3FileSize":29096,"parentId":null,"guid":null,"pubdateTimezone":"America/Los_Angeles","originalFilename":"06.23.26_IP_#17.mp4","spotifyIdentifier":"4YiWO1WkJcrnqfqI9ea2NK","expectedAdhash":"","audioFileUpdatedAt":null,"draft":false,"externalId":null,"cleanTitle":"","customFields":[],"contentRating":"unspecified","episodeConfigType":"podcast","promotionalContent":false,"podcastTitle":"Inflection Point","networkId":"104de192-0570-11e9-af98-f39c567501b8","podcastAuthor":"Blockworks","podcastItunesCategories":["Tech News","Business News","Investing"],"episodeVideoThumbnailUrl":"https://storage.googleapis.com/megaphone-prod/podcasts/701a8bb0-75e0-11eb-b1ed-cb043298ccf9/thumbnails/ab7198e4-6f49-11f1-af3d-f764af5bfcf2/9c5aaeaa251cb9605fdb0848eb5a1474.png?GoogleAccessId=megaphone-cms%40megaphone-prod.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u0026Expires=1789458785\u0026Signature=QTTuOVPJ7iVVmB%2FDmEOJfAYXccgERk1jiq%2BqyFUqL6Ox7ReXSgh4drn6DSyB%2BTH%2BUUsw%2F2so4uEK8u4%2BaMw%2F3miCrPXkYbyA0L4rPvTlz%2BP5w8OmB71l0D9ZVJiy3ezTWK9qWwE%2F6HJzo1GpsIV9uCTD%2B0wPLNxriMbbFxw%2FzU8nmoa7VRPWpr%2FFGKya7UszG8LFAlDgD%2BGmf4%2F%2FE%2FHjFq0qDxKD1FRemGt2Ei%2FCJNT8vhC4ur1wsabUQJ%2FqZGcZMK04JEFSo1wLz2ycc%2B7ORk2dB%2Fzuwf6XiW1pzpO5GZZDwt3kjMDwKGad7AJYBTrvAty8sjGnQ1UGjT9zhB4WDg%3D%3D","advertisingTags":[],"mainFeed":true,"adFree":false,"audioFileStatus":"success","status":"published","rssStatus":"published","spotifyStatus":"live","cuepoints":[],"mediaFileUrl":null,"imageFileUrl":null}}],"imageUrl":"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/701a8bb0-75e0-11eb-b1ed-cb043298ccf9/image/e962f90fe42381a818bfd304f68da892.jpg?ixlib=rails-4.3.1\u0026w=216\u0026h=216\u0026fit=crop\u0026auto=format%2Ccompress","title":"Inflection Point","href":"/podcast/inflectionpoint"}],"researchArticles":[{"id":"487","slug":"meta-dao-built-for-the-next-ico-boom","href":"https://app.blockworksresearch.com/research/meta-dao-built-for-the-next-ico-boom","title":"MetaDAO: Built for the Next ICO Boom","timePosted":1788862948,"imageUrl":"https://impressive-horses-5641a8b530.media.strapiapp.com/Meta_DAO_White_Built_for_the_Next_ICO_Boom_Carlos_2_423b604a53.jpg","description":"MetaDAO has turned ownership coins from an experiment into a functioning capital formation platform, but its next challenge is distribution. If it can leverage Solana’s strong startup ecosystem and favorable US regulation to increase launch cadence and produce durable winners, MetaDAO could emerge as a leading venue for Internet Capital Markets and move early-stage fundraising toward open, liquid markets."},{"id":"486","slug":"tokenized-equities-on-solana-from-issuance-to-execution","href":"https://app.blockworksresearch.com/research/tokenized-equities-on-solana-from-issuance-to-execution","title":"Tokenized Equities on Solana: From Issuance to Execution","timePosted":1788521759,"imageUrl":"https://impressive-horses-5641a8b530.media.strapiapp.com/Solana_White_09dcd5e049.jpg","description":"Solana’s tokenized-equity market is becoming a live test of whether public blockchains can expand beyond crypto-native trading into global financial markets. Backpack has generated more DEX volume across single-name equities, while xStocks has recently regained the weekly lead and moves ahead overall when including ETF volume such as SPY. More importantly, Backpack’s prop-AMM-heavy liquidity stack consistently delivered tighter execution than xStocks’ pool-heavy model, with Solana’s composability allowing those liquidity benefits to spill across competing issuer wrappers. Against Robinhood Chain, Solana also combines better execution with dramatically lower fees, reinforcing that scalable onchain finance depends not simply on creating blockspace, but on the market structure and infrastructure built on top of it."},{"id":"485","slug":"maple-s-missing-rally","href":"https://app.blockworksresearch.com/research/maple-s-missing-rally","title":"Maple’s Missing Rally","timePosted":1787901931,"imageUrl":"https://impressive-horses-5641a8b530.media.strapiapp.com/Maple_White_d3614ef324.jpg","description":"Crypto lending has rallied 46.7% over the past week, making it the strongest sector tracked by Blockworks Research, yet Maple has been left behind. Since September 2025, Maple’s deposits have grown 69% to $4.9B and outstanding loans have risen 78% to $1.8B, while SYRUP is down 52%. Distribution is also widening through Robinhood and Kraken, while Ethena could become a sizeable source of institutional lending demand. This report examines what the market may be missing, what needs to change for earnings to grow again and whether wider distribution and rules-based buybacks are enough to bring SYRUP back into the spotlight."},{"id":"484","slug":"the-cross-asset-shift","href":"https://app.blockworksresearch.com/research/the-cross-asset-shift","title":"The Cross Asset Shift","timePosted":1787642571,"imageUrl":"https://impressive-horses-5641a8b530.media.strapiapp.com/Sponsored_Article_Template_Cross_Asset_Shift_31d5433cb6.jpg","description":"Crypto traders are no longer limiting themselves to crypto. Across Asia, users are turning to CEXs for gold, US equities and other traditional assets. MEXC’s survey found that 87.2% plan to increase their TradFi trading, while futures tied to RWAs, forex and tokenized stocks reached nearly $400B in July. Gold has emerged as the clearest entry point, with precious metals accounting for 36.2% of TradFi perp open interest by the end of June. This report examines why Asia is well positioned for this shift and what CEXs still need to build, from deeper spot markets and weekend liquidity to better pricing, custody and settlement."}],"event":{"title":"Digital Asset Summit Asia 2026","eventDescription":"DAS Asia is a a single-day summit at Marina Bay Sands Singapore featuring conversations between the builders, investors, and global leaders are shaping the trajectory of the digital asset ecosystem in Asia \u0026 North America.","eventDetailsHref":"/event/digital-asset-summit-asia","eventImage":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/m7wk9dud/production/b4733cf78bd7ee3773cdfd8e1dbb74456536ee72-1920x1080.png","speakersViewMoreHref":"/event/digital-asset-summit-asia/speakers","registerHref":"https://luma.com/event/evt-EIeXOplHoF0mz7E","learnMoreHref":"/event/digital-asset-summit-asia","speakers":[{"name":"Justin Sun","description":"Founder","imageUrl":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/m7wk9dud/production/fe62f659f8bc87cda563e6b0f13d604857f88cd6-600x600.png","href":"/event/digital-asset-summit-asia/speakers","company":"TRON"},{"name":"Jeff Yan","description":"Co-Founder \u0026 CEO","imageUrl":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/m7wk9dud/production/9374f7b32ccdf4aac0170437bea27adbccefdb25-600x600.png","href":"/event/digital-asset-summit-asia/speakers","company":"Hyperliquid Labs"},{"name":"Arjun Sethi","description":"Co-CEO","imageUrl":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/m7wk9dud/production/20ed415d0044648606dab707b30ac36882cef205-600x600.png","href":"/event/digital-asset-summit-asia/speakers","company":"Kraken \u0026 Payward"},{"name":"Cynthia Lo Bessette","description":"Head of Digital Asset Management","imageUrl":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/m7wk9dud/production/5fc987d332f0d9da31c8323f7e38ee90c1bbce83-600x600.png","href":"/event/digital-asset-summit-asia/speakers","company":"Fidelity Investments"},{"name":"Richard Teng","descriptio